	<short-description type="string">Announces nearby flight landmarks via on-screen ATC messages.</short-description>
	
	<long-description type="string">TourGuide queries FlightGear's POI database (cities, towns, villages, and visual reporting points) to deliver sector-aware spatial announcements (ahead, left, right, behind, and directly below) via ATC messages. Supports on-demand hotkey triggers as well as automatic periodic flight-time announcements.</long-description> 
	
